    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abce26ecd1168.80166216\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">We've datamined new music for the Patch 12.1.5 raid boss, Kith'ix. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/patch-12-1-5-overview-features-activities-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Patch 12.1.5 Overview</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8214194.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>Kith'ix is the new one-boss raid in Patch 12.1.5 that is part of the Midnight story. After defeating Ula'tek, Kith'ix has been unbound, and players must face Kith'ix with the help of Lady Liadrin. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-fs3Fn8gW9s/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/uOEeiXQ82Ys/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>We've datamined new music for the Patch 12.1.5 raid boss, Kith'ix. <br /><br />Patch 12.1.5 Overview<br /><br />Kith'ix is the new one-boss raid in Patch 12.1.5 that is part of the Midnight story. After defeating Ula'tek, Kith'ix has been unbound, and players must face Kith'ix with the help of Lady Liadrin. <br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
