    "title": {
      "en": "Weekly Bonus Rolls Start Next Week - Bonus Rolls and Ascendant Venomstones Unlock Schedule",
      "es": "Las tiradas de bonificación semanales comienzan la próxima semana: las tiradas de bonificación y las piedras venenosas ascendentes desbloquean el programa"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Weekly Bonus Rolls Start Next Week - Bonus Rolls and Ascendant Venomstones Unlock Schedule...",
      "es": "Las tiradas de bonificación semanales comienzan la próxima semana: las tiradas de bonificación y las piedras venenosas ascendentes desbloquean el programa..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6abce0b6d87be9.72401319\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced that weekly Bonus Rolls will unlock next week, with more power coming soon in the following weeks. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/bonus-rolls-item-upgrades\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Bonus Loot Rolls &amp; Ascendant Venomstones</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_1205_voidforge_fluctuatingvoidcores_green.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><div class=\"injected-ad-container\"><div class=\"htlad-desktop-dynamic-btf tude-ads\"><div id=\"desktop-dynamic-btf\" class=\"htl-ad\"></div></div></div><br><br>With Patch 12.1.5 launching on October 13th, Blizzard has revealed the schedule for more of the player power systems coming in the next few weeks:<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">October 6th - Weekly Bonus Rolls unlocks</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">October 13th - New Patch</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">October 20th - Ascendant Venomstones unlocks &amp; Crest Cap removed</div></li></ul><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-gb/news/24307306\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><h2 id=\"mid-season-refresh-unlock-new-power\" class=\"heading-size-2 first\">Mid-Season Refresh: Unlock New Power</h2><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/y1/Y1J9Q92R6AZE1787854522909.png\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image no-border\" src=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/y1/Y1J9Q92R6AZE1787854522909.png\" alt=\"\"></a><br>During realm maintenance the week of 7 October , Orin Straylight will begin to offer one additional Nebulous Voidcore a week to bonus roll for additional loot.<br><br>Prepare to unlock these additional Nebulous Voidcores before Midnight’s 12.1.5 content update goes live. First, accept the \"In the Catalyst's Shadow\" quest from Decimus in Voidstorm, then travel to Silvermoon City and pick up the “Prismatic Potential” quest from Orin Straylight. To get an early start on the Nebulous Voidcore quest chain, we encourage Azeroth’s brave champions to complete both quests before weekly maintenance during the week of October 6.<br><br>Once “Prismatic Potential” is turned in, Orin can begin his research, and a progress timer will appear above his head. After completing his research during the week of October 6, he will offer the quest \"Umbral Blessings of the Catalyst\". Completing this quest will unlock the ability to trade in gold, Voidlight Marl, or Veteran Mistcrests to Orin for one additional Nebulous Voidcore a week.<br><br>During realm maintenance the week of October 13, Orin will offer the quest, \"Ancient Depths, Ancient Venom\". Once this quest is complete, Orin will begin his next research of Ascendant Venomstones. Orin will complete his research during realm maintenance the week of October 20 and offer players \"Ascending with Venomstones\", letting players take their power to new heights. Completing this quest will empower defenders of the realm to acquire Ascendant Venomstones, which drop from every Heroic or Mythic raid boss, Mythic+ Keystone dungeons at +10 and above, Tier 11 Bountiful Delves, and Nightmare Prey Hunt Champion gear chests.<br><br>After collecting 10 Ascendant Venomstones, use them near the Catalyst in Silvermoon City to raise the item level of a fully upgraded Season 2 Hero, Myth, or maximum-quality Tidal Crafted weapon, trinket, or necklace.<br><br>Along with Ascendant Venomstones, the week of 20 October, the crest cap will be lifted.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced that weekly Bonus Rolls will unlock next week, with more power coming soon in the following weeks. <br /><br />Bonus Loot Rolls &amp; Ascendant Venomstones<br /><br />With Patch 12.1.5 launching on October 13th, Blizzard has revealed the schedule for more of the player power systems coming in the next few weeks:<br /><ul><li>October 6th - Weekly Bonus Rolls unlocks</li><li>October 13th - New Patch</li><li>October 20th - Ascendant Venomstones unlocks &amp; Crest Cap removed</li></ul><br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\"> Mid-Season Refresh: Unlock New Power </h2><a href=\"https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/content_entry_media/y1/Y1J9Q92R6AZE1787854522909.png\" rel=\"nofollow\"></a><br />During realm maintenance the week of 7 October , Orin Straylight will begin to offer one additional Nebulous Voidcore a week to bonus roll for additional loot.<br /><br />Prepare to unlock these additional Nebulous Voidcores before Midnight’s 12.1.5 content update goes live. First, accept the &quot;In the Catalyst's Shadow&quot; quest from Decimus in Voidstorm, then travel to Silvermoon City and pick up the “Prismatic Potential” quest from Orin Straylight. To get an early start on the Nebulous Voidcore quest chain, we encourage Azeroth’s brave champions to complete both quests before weekly maintenance during the week of October 6.<br /><br />Once “Prismatic Potential” is turned in, Orin can begin his research, and a progress timer will appear above his head. After completing his research during the week of October 6, he will offer the quest &quot;Umbral Blessings of the Catalyst&quot;. Completing this quest will unlock the ability to trade in gold, Voidlight Marl, or Veteran Mistcrests to Orin for one additional Nebulous Voidcore a week.<br /><br />During realm maintenance the week of October 13, Orin will offer the quest, &quot;Ancient Depths, Ancient Venom&quot;. Once this quest is complete, Orin will begin his next research of Ascendant Venomstones. Orin will complete his research during realm maintenance the week of October 20 and offer players &quot;Ascending with Venomstones&quot;, letting players take their power to new heights. Completing this quest will empower defenders of the realm to acquire Ascendant Venomstones, which drop from every Heroic or Mythic raid boss, Mythic+ Keystone dungeons at +10 and above, Tier 11 Bountiful Delves, and Nightmare Prey Hunt Champion gear chests.<br /><br />After collecting 10 Ascendant Venomstones, use them near the Catalyst in Silvermoon City to raise the item level of a fully upgraded Season 2 Hero, Myth, or maximum-quality Tidal Crafted weapon, trinket, or necklace.<br /><br />Along with Ascendant Venomstones, the week of 20 October, the crest cap will be lifted.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
